// CONTRACT BEAT (seeded by the lead; owned by east): asserts hasBadge(spark).
// The engine keeps the gym behind portvoltTree until canPass(portvoltTree).
// Volta's crew (lore/east/trainers-gyms.lute) stand by the switches.

## The switch room

::bg{location="spark-gym" time="day"}
::music{action="change" mood="tense" volume="normal"}
@narrator{code="0010"}: The gym floor hums. Every lamp in the room is wired to a switch on the far wall, and the switches are wired to something that crackles.
@narrator{code="0020" when="holds('defeated', ['sparkGymEngineerWatts']) && holds('defeated', ['sparkGymSailorFlint']) && holds('defeated', ['sparkGymRockerJolt'])"}: Volta's whole crew is watching from the switches, rubbing their singed eyebrows.

## Lt. Volta

::use{component="gymLeader" who="volta" badge="spark" intro="Hey, kid! What do you think you're doing here? You won't live long in combat, not with your puny power! I tell you, kid, electric monsters saved me during the war!" win="Whoa! You're the real deal, kid! Fine then, take the Spark Badge!" lose="Ha! Zapped! That's what happens, kid." prize="2400" instance="use-001"}
@volta{code="0010" emotion="laughing" when="@wonFight"}: Your spiky-haired pal came through yesterday, you know. Lost in three turns and tried to fight the switchboard. Ha! Kid's got spirit.
@volta{code="0020" when="@wonFight"}: With the Spark Badge your monsters will use Fly outside battle, once somebody teaches them. Go and see Fern in Bloomfield. If she's awake.
